>>
endobj
470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (This committee also works in tandem with the United Nations Disarmament Commission and the Conference on Disarmament, which meets in Geneva. Sessions of DISEC take a tripartite structure.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
471 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (First, there is a general debate, where the committee decides on which topics will be covered. This is followed by a stage of thematic discussions, and the process is concluded with action on drafts.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
472 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (As enshrined in the United Nations \(UN\) Charter, all member states and observers of the UN are permitted to be a member of DISEC.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (The First Committee may pass resolutions by a simple majority, recommending that member states take specific or general actions. As a General Assembly committee, it does not have the power to pass binding resolutions, nor does it have the power to sanction.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
