624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (As the number of states possessing chemical weapons steadily declined, the CWC appeared to be in the final technical stage of implementation, and some countries began questioning the sustainability of the Organization for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons \(OPCW\), the implementing body of the treaty.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (It seemed that chemical weapons had been successfully managed and controlled through a robust international system of treaties, laws, and cooperative arrangements that led to a near universal CW disarmament.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
